{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30844","headline":"荅太原从军杨员外送别 · 马戴","name":"荅太原从军杨员外送别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君将海月佩，赠之光我行。\n见知言不浅，怀报意非轻。\n反照临歧思，中年未达情。\n河梁人送别，秋汉鴈相鸣。\n衰柳摇边吹，寒云冒古城。\n西游还献赋，应许托平生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}